re a visit. Ask what information will be useful and bring what you actually have. Missing information is a question to resolve, not a reason to postpone the conversation.",{"children":"You do not need to invent a new tracking routine before a visit. Ask what information will be useful and bring what you actually have. Missing information is a question to resolve, not a reason to postpone the conversation."}]],false]}],["$","section","Make a one-page visit summary",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make a one-page visit summary"}],[["$","p","Divide a sheet into four short headings. This keeps the appointment focused while preserving the details you may need.",{"children":"Divide a sheet into four short headings. This keeps the appointment focused while preserving the details you may need."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"article-checklist","children":[["$","li","Changed: medicines, specialists, hospital visits or anything new since the last appointment.",{"children":"Changed: medicines, specialists, hospital visits or anything new since the last appointment."}],["$","li","Tracked: the dates covered by any glucose or blood-pressure record you were asked to keep.",{"children":"Tracked: the dates covered by any glucose or blood-pressure record you were asked to keep."}],["$","li","Difficult: supplies, prescription cost, unclear instructions or fitting the plan into daily life.",{"children":"Difficult: supplies, prescription cost, unclear instructions or fitting the plan into daily life."}],["$","li","Questions: the two issues you most want to understand today.",{"children":"Questions: the two issues you most want to understand today."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Bring the originals behind the summary",{"id":"section-2","children":["$L28",["$L29","$L2a"],false]}],"$L2b"],"$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"]}]]}]
