29:["$","p","Keep medication containers, device records and outside laboratory reports together. For a report, include the laboratory name and date. For a device, make sure you can open the record or bring a readable printout.",{"children":"Keep medication containers, device records and outside laboratory reports together. For a report, include the laboratory name and date. For a device, make sure you can open the record or bring a readable printout."}]
2a:["$","p","If several clinicians are involved, list their names and upcoming appointments. Ask which office is arranging each test or referral. That simple ownership question can prevent an important task from being left between offices.",{"children":"If several clinicians are involved, list their names and upcoming appointments. Ask which office is arranging each test or referral. That simple ownership question can prevent an important task from being left between offices."}]
2b:["$","section","Leave with a short action list",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Leave with a short action list"}],[["$","p","Write the next action beside a person or office: “I arrange…,” “the office sends…” or “we discuss at the next visit….” Ask when to follow up if you have not heard anything.",{"children":"Write the next action beside a person or office: “I arrange…,” “the office sends…” or “we discuss at the next visit….” Ask when to follow up if you have not heard anything."}],["$","p","For established patients, Healow can help with appointment questions, lab orders, results and refills. Use practice code FGCJBD. Call when the concern is time-sensitive. New patients arrange their first visit by phone with the San Bernardino office.",{"children":"For established patients, Healow can help with appointment questions, lab orders, results and refills. Use practice code FGCJBD. Call when the concern is time-sensitive. New patients arrange their first visit by phone with the San Bernardino office."}]],false]}]
